{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK13ClientProfileO4fromACs7Decoder_p_tKcfc","roleHeading":"Initializer","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP","text":"Decoder"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"title":"init(from:)","symbolKind":"init","role":"symbol"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile\/init(from:)-757he"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"decoder"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP","text":"Decoder","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The synthesised ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RawRepresentable"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer stays strict — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init(rawValue:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" for a value that is not a case — so code that deliberately parses a raw string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps its check. Only DECODING, where the alternative is failing a whole response, is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lenient."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Decodes an unrecognised value to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" instead of throwing."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile\/init(from:)-757he"]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","title":"AxiamSDK","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"Self::Standard":{"title":"Standard","identifier":"Self::Standard","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Standard"}],"type":"link","url":"Self::Standard"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ClientProfile":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Which security posture a client is registered under (X5.1). This is the FAPI “one switch”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"FAPI 2.0 is not a single feature but a bundle of constraints — mandatory PAR, mandatory PKCE","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"S256"},{"text":", mandatory strong client authentication, mandatory sender-constrained tokens,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a refusal of every relaxation the base specs permit. Encoding them as one profile rather","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than a dozen independent booleans means an operator cannot register a client that is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"nearly","type":"text"}]},{"text":" FAPI, and a reviewer can answer “is this client financial-grade?” by reading one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"field. The same philosophy as the rate-limit postures: ordinary clients see no behaviour","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change at all, because ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"Self::Standard","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is the serde default and every row","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written before schema v38 decodes to it.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ClientProfile","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ClientProfile","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"ClientProfile"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ClientProfile/init(from:)-757he":{"kind":"symbol","title":"init(from:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile\/init(from:)-757he","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7DecoderP","text":"Decoder"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Decodes an unrecognised value to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" instead of throwing."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/clientprofile\/init(from:)-757he","role":"symbol"}}}